The retained Qwen 3.8 source-proposal route downloads a pinned auxiliary
weight artifact directly from amal-david/qwen38-mtp-head-q2-q4-rerank-v1.
The artifact's full MTP body records EigenLabs/Qwen3.8-27B-MTP-bf16 as its
source; that repository declares Apache-2.0. The auxiliary repository itself
does not currently declare separate license metadata. Exact revisions, hashes,
lineage, and distribution status are recorded in
docs/perf/qwen38-source-artifact-manifest.json.
